{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t土耳其空軍一架直升機執行訓練任務期間墜毀，5名士兵喪生。<br/>\n<br/>\n國防部表示，空軍一架AS-532型直升機，星期二從西部埃斯基謝希爾省起飛，執行訓練任務，但其後失事墜毀。<br/>\n<br/>\n消防、醫療及警方已經趕到事發區域，展開搜救及調查工作，國防部的聲明暫時未有提及直升機失事原因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T20:44:19.861163+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T20:17:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:17:59.240069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T20:37:43.024485+00:00","content_hash":"03fe05aae92800656d71f80b4eebf32c92ef8ed00c738910b8a3ba3afe194852","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}